WEBVTT

00:00:20.952 --> 00:00:23.838
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Hi. Sorry I’m late. What time’s the show?

00:00:23.839 --> 00:00:25.587
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Don’t worry. It’s at eight o’clock.

00:00:25.774 --> 00:00:26.902
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> What time is it now?

00:00:26.903 --> 00:00:29.396
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> It’s OK. It’s only twenty to eight.

00:00:52.396 --> 00:00:54.120
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> What a great show!

00:00:54.121 --> 00:00:55.702
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Yes, fantastic.

00:00:57.019 --> 00:00:59.160
I’m hungry. Do you want a pizza?

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:00.758
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> What time is it?

00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:05.160
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Um, quarter to eleven.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:08.455
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> It’s late and I’m tired.

00:01:08.618 --> 00:01:12.193
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> Come on. I know a really good Italian restaurant near here.

00:01:13.003 --> 00:01:15.303
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Oh, OK. Let’s go.